 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 666489,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Which program prints the following output?\n<pre class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">1 2 3 4\n2 4 6 8\n3 6 9 12\n4 8 12 16\n</pre>\n",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1328520,
     "content_html": "<pre class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">i = 1\nwhile i &lt;= 4:\n&nbsp;&nbsp;while j &lt;= 4:\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;print(i * j, end = ' ')\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;j += 1\n&nbsp;&nbsp;print()\n&nbsp;&nbsp;i += 1\n</pre>\n",
     "correctness": "0.0",
     "feedback_html": "In the first outer loop's execution <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">(i = 1)</code>, <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">j</code>'s value becomes 1, 2, 3, and 4. In the second outer loop's execution <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">(i = 2)</code>, <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">j</code>'s value equals 4 and hence the inner loop does not execute. What should change so the inner loop can be executed again?"
    },
    {
     "id": 1328521,
     "content_html": "<pre class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">i = 1\nwhile i &lt;= 4:\n&nbsp;&nbsp;j = 1\n&nbsp;&nbsp;while j &lt;= 4:\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;print(i * j, end = ' ')\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;j += 1\n&nbsp;&nbsp;print()\n&nbsp;&nbsp;i += 1\n</pre>\n",
     "correctness": "1.0",
     "feedback_html": "Each line <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">i</code> of the output (<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">i = </code><code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">1</code>, <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">2</code>, <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">3</code>, and <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">4</code>) contains <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">i</code> times values <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">1</code> through <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">4</code>.<br> Hence, the outer loop executes while <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">i &lt;= 4</code>, and the inner loop iterates over<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">j</code> while <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">j</code>'s value is less than or equal to <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">4</code>."
    },
    {
     "id": 1328522,
     "content_html": "<pre class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">i = 1\nwhile i &lt;= 4:\n&nbsp;&nbsp;j = 1\n&nbsp;&nbsp;while j &lt;= 4:\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;print(i * j, end = ' ')\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;j += 1\n&nbsp;&nbsp;i += 1\n</pre>\n",
     "correctness": "0.0",
     "feedback_html": "The given code prints all values in one line. To add a new line every time that the value of <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">i</code> changes, a <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">print()</code> statement must be added at the end of the loop."
    }
   ],
