     "content_html": "Each line <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">i</code> of the output (<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">i = </code><code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">1</code>, <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">2</code>, <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">3</code>, and <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">4</code>) contains <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">i</code> times values <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">1</code> through <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">4</code>.<br> Hence, the outer loop executes while <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">i &lt;= 4</code>, and the inner loop iterates over<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">j</code> while <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">j</code>'s value is less than or equal to <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">4</code>."
